=== prologue_intro ===
~ Event("player_control_off")
Father: Well… here we are. #avatar:father #voice:father_001
Mother: Looks smaller than it did in the estate agent’s photographs. #avatar:mother #voice:mother_001
Jack: How long’s it been empty? #avatar:jack #voice:jack_001
Father: Long enough. #avatar:father #voice:father_002
Mother: Jack, love, could you give us a hand with these boxes? #avatar:mother #voice:mother_002
~ Event("objective_help_parents_move")
~ Event("player_control_on")
-> END
